# Yuriko, Hope from the Shadows: Flash, and "When Yuriko enters, choose one - Target creature gets -X/-0 until end of turn,
# where X is the number of cards in your graveyard." Bot1 puts Lightning Bolt and Shock into its graveyard in turn 1 (two
# cards); in Bot2's turn 2, Bot2 casts Hired Blade (3/2) and an Opt, so Bot2's own graveyard holds one card. At Bot2's end
# step Bot1 flashes Yuriko in and shrinks the Hired Blade by X = 2 (Bot1's graveyard only, never Bot2's): 1/2 (and 2 is not
# 3 = both graveyards). After the turn ends the Blade is 3/2 again.

